<%= header_section("#{PlatformConfig.app_name} payout returned") %>
<div>
  <p>Hi,</p>
  <p>We attempted to send your payout from <%= PlatformConfig.app_name %> but were not able to because your financial institution was unable to locate your account based on the information you have given us.</p>
  <p>Please visit <%= link_to "your payout settings", settings_payments_url %> and update your bank account information.</p>
  <p>In the meantime <%= @payment.displayed_amount %> has been deposited back into your <%= PlatformConfig.app_name %> account balance.</p>
</div>
